### Live Vercel Deployment
# Base URL: https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app

### 1. Root route (Live)
GET https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/

### 2. GET all books (Live)
GET https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/books/

### 3. GET single book by ID (Live)
GET https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/books/1/

### 4. POST add a new book (Live)
POST https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Code",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "price": 650,
  "pages": 464
}

### 5. PUT update existing book (Live)
PUT https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/books/1/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Great Gatsby (Collector's Edition)",
  "author": "F. Scott Fitzgerald",
  "price": 599,
  "pages": 195
}

### 6. DELETE book by ID (Live)
DELETE https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/books/11/

### 7. GET non-existent book - 404 test (Live)
GET https://bdf-lab-02-puneeth-b7sp.vercel.app/books/999/

---

### Local Development
# Base URL: http://localhost:3000

### 1. Root route (Local)
GET http://localhost:3000/

### 2. GET all books (Local)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### 3. GET single book by ID (Local)
GET http://localhost:3000/books/1/
